                <property name="label">This application needs to spawn a &lt;b&gt;privileged subprocess&lt;/b&gt; in order to operate.


This process will run under the name "diagmond-bin" and will be able to:

•  Enumerate the USB devices and interfaces on your machine.
•  After prompting for extra authorization, open and forward an USB serial device to the application when needed.
• Open and forward a raw USB interface to the application when needed.

This process will run as a D-Bus system service and use Polkit for granting the extra authorizations.

